                        "entry_id": "5bb76ac0-1bed-3334-a5bd-3243f4ad26a5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A region viewed in the context of its climate; a clime or zone."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "obsolete"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "abd0d490-173a-4e19-a7d1-88a5b77f7c2a",
                                "sense_id": "0a5c8e9a-69a3-389e-b1cc-0f830a056961",
                                "text": "King Henry and his faction nesteled and strēgthēd him and his alies in the North regions and boreal plage."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1d124ca3-9c8c-441a-9984-66c2dba7e5ee",
                                "sense_id": "0a5c8e9a-69a3-389e-b1cc-0f830a056961",
                                "text": "Tam[burlaine]. Kings of Argier, Morocus, and of Feſſe,\nYou that haue martcht with happie Tamburlain,\nAs far as from the frozen place ^([sic – meaning plage]) of heauen,\nUnto the watrie mornings ruddy hower ^([sic – meaning bower])."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f419b447-91e5-4c56-ae30-1221d9a7651c",
                                "sense_id": "0a5c8e9a-69a3-389e-b1cc-0f830a056961",
                                "text": "In the Heauens, they supposed a burning Zone; in the Earth, a Plage [translating Latin plaga], plagued with scorching heats."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8283b4f9-f02b-3dde-9e7b-8178b5b0f23f",
                        "entry_id": "5bb76ac0-1bed-3334-a5bd-3243f4ad26a5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A bright region in the chromosphere of the Sun."
